Use AI to apply the Git Diff updates for identical tests
Often multiple tests will exist for a single feature or page and a lot of the test code itself will be identical, with minor differences only unique to the individual test case itself. For example, creating a Buy order and verifying the order may be exactly identical to creating a Sell order and verifying the order, with the unique exception of clicking Buy vs. Sell on the page.

For these scenarios, as tests require maintenance or updates, we can leverage AI to apply updates we make for one test to all other identical tests without going line-by-line in a traditional manual labor intensive style.

Make changes to the first test case and copy the Git Diff


Prompt the AI to apply the same changes to the twin test case and use repl to verify each change before accepting to ensure the code is correct and makes sense!


